==== JTAG ====

^ TP1      ^ TP2   ^ TP3   ^ TP4   ^ TP5   ^
| TRST_L   | TDI   | TDO   | TMS   | TCK   |

TP1 is near the Serial VDD Pin.

TP2-5 are on the right next to the SoC.

each JTAG Pin has its own solderpad, but is not populated.

